  "description": "How to calculate your true reward-to-risk ratio using historical backtesting data, slippage metrics, and execution friction to guarantee a mathematical edge.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "EV Kelly Engine"
  },
  "publisher": {
